Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Main-State Convergence Trial: (a, c) = (5, 1)", "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9944030526898975`*^9, 
  3.994403054264002*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e776b8ba-3bb2-0749-b58b-\
61f2fff6cb5a"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook performs the approved timed, fixed-parameter convergence sweep \
at (a, c)=(5, 1). It imports the existing production optimum, evaluates \
MaxPoints = 10^6, 2x10^6, and 5x10^6 with PrecisionGoal = 4, and records the \
time, value, warning status, and reported NIntegrate error for every \
integral. It does not run either minimizer, change package defaults, or \
overwrite production results. Evaluate the input cell once. Checkpoints are \
written after every completed budget.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.994403059279545*^9, 
  3.994403060587454*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"888acffd-28cd-6640-a1a8-\
781bc9d7766d"],

